    <p class="kicker">About the author</p>
    <h2 id="about-author">Joshua Ediale</h2>
    <p>With over 1,000 live sessions led, over 500 vocalists trained and singers coached across 5 Nigerian states, Joshua Ediale is a worship leader, singer, songwriter and vocal coach. He has led music since 2009, served as Music Director at Christian Charismatic Church, Warri, and has been worship lead and lead vocalist at RHOGIC Abuja since 2018. He is the author of <em>The Leadsinger's Handbook</em> and is studying music theory with Yale.</p>
